# Quick Add to the inbox from the Today view adds a task dated today that shows in the view at once; undo takes it out and redo brings it back.
file <<END
INBOX: @inbox
	- Renew passport @due({today-3})
Work:
	- Write report @due({today-2})
END
keys gt q
type Call mom today
keys <Enter>
see - Call mom  INBOX
keys z
hide Call mom
keys Z
see - Call mom  INBOX
quit
saved <<END
INBOX: @inbox
	- Renew passport @due({today-3})
	- Call mom @start({today})
Work:
	- Write report @due({today-2})
END
